<title>INDIA: Gujral calls news conference.</title>
<headline>Gujral calls news conference.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Inder Kumar Gujral has called a news conference at 10.30 a.m. (0500 GMT). The news conference was originally scheduled at 9.15 a.m. (0345 GMT) and then postponed.</p>
<p>The Prime Minister's office has not indicated the reason for the news conference.</p>
